      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We build barbed wire, pipe, and game fence for cattle and hay operations along the North Bosque River. Free written estimates on both sides of the Bosque County line.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
